&lt;summary&gt;讲师备注&lt;/summary&gt;
&lt;p&gt;实际中我们不会用指针写 &lt;code&gt;swap&lt;/code&gt; 函数——用引用就能安全完成。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>3.5.2 Unsafe 外部函数</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/comprehensiveRust/day4-afternoon/unsafe-rust/unsafe-functions/02-extern-c/</link><pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 11:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/Rust/comprehensiveRust/day4-afternoon/unsafe-rust/unsafe-functions/02-extern-c/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
